    title: "Catalogue the READ calls behind the handle constructors (bufio.Reader.ReadString, Scanner.Scan/Text, os.File.Read and peers): go's entire stdin surface is three deferred-crossing rows with no transfer row to relocate a crossing to"  # 3bc7
